---

Vendored dependency: pyo-src/ contains a copy of Pyo (https://github.com/belangeo/pyo)
licensed under LGPLv3+. See pyo-src/LICENSE for its terms. The MIT license above
applies to Phonon's own source only.

Distributing built artifacts that bundle compiled Pyo binaries (e.g. wheels with
pyo._pyo / pyo._pyo64 bundled in) triggers Pyo's LGPLv3+ relink obligation: the
recipient must be able to relink the artifact against a modified Pyo. Distributing
Phonon as source-only (pip install from git, conda recipe with separate Pyo build)
does not trigger the relink obligation since Pyo is built locally from pyo-src/.
